{"articleNo":"2746","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2746&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 1학기 휴복학 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.31","hit":"13441","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">★ 휴</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">·</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">복학 신청 안내 ★</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12.7pt\">2011학년도 1학기 휴·복학신청을 인터넷으로 접수받습니다. 안내문에 따라 원스톱서비스에서 신청하시기 바라며, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">휴·복학 확정 여부를 반드시 확인하여 학적상의 불이익이 발생하지 않도록 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(등록금인상분 미납자는 휴복학 불가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13.6pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">※필수 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13.6pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2011학년도 이전 입학자 중 전공 미배정된 1학년 복학생에 대한 안내<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;ο 대상자 : 2011학년도 이전 입학자 중 전공 미배정된 1학년 복학자<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;ο </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신청방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">반드시 방문 신청(학생회관 1층 학사서비스센터)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">을 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">해야 하며,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12.7pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">해당 종합학사행정실에 직접 방문하여 전공배정에 관한 사전상담 요망</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 휴학 신청(인터넷 신청)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">구&nbsp; 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"84\" colspan=\"2\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">일반 휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"360\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">군입대 휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"77\" colspan=\"2\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">질병 휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신청 기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"5\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2011. 2. 1(화) 10 : 00 ~ 2. 11(금) 23 : 59까지</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ 위 기간 경과 후에는 학사서비스센터로 직접 방문 신청하여야 함.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신청 방법</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"5\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">홈페이지→원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→휴학신청접수</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"77\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"66\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">제출 서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"77\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"32\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"435\" colspan=\"3\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">입영통지서 사본 or 군복무확인서 사본</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"34\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"54\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4주이상 진단서</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"435\" colspan=\"3\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">1. 학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">번, 연락처를 기재하여 휴학신청 당일(24시까지) 제출.</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">서류 미제출자는 3일후 휴학신청 자동 취소됨.</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"54\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"86\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">제출 장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"86\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"5\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">1. 학사관리팀(학사서비스센터) or 팩스(054-478-7069)</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2. 팩스로 제출한 학생 중 신청 익일 1시 이후 처리가 되어 있지 않은 학생은</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;팩스 도착여부를 반드시 확인 바람(☎ 054-478-7066)</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">*군입대 휴학 후, 귀향조치 및 입영 거부된 학생은&nbsp;즉시 학사관리팀으로 연락</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;바람.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">확정 여부</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"40\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"5\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 확정 : 휴학 신청 후(서류 제출 후) 다음날 오후 1시 이후</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→학적 및 각종자료조회→학적변동내역</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ 군입대 휴학을 원하나 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000\">입영통지서가 아직 나오지 않은 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">은 우선 일반휴학을 신청하고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;입영통지서가 나오는대로 팩스만 보내주시면 일반휴학에서 군입대휴학으로 변경됩니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 일반휴학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(2011년 3월 28일)까지만 허용. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">휴학생도 2월 22일부터 25일까지 등록금 납부 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(납부기간경과 후 납부할 수 없으며 장학금혜택도 받을 수 없음).</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 휴학생은 수강신청 불가.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 복학 신청(인터넷 신청) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">▶ 2011학년도 이전 입학자 중 전공 미배정된 1학년 복학자에 대한 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대상자 : 2011학년도 이전 입학자 중 전공 미배정된 1학년 복학자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신청방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">반드시 방문 신청(학사서비스센터)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">을 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">해야 하며, 인터넷 신청은 불가함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;해당 종합학사행정실에 직접 방문하여 전공배정에 관하여 사전 상담 요망</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 수강신청 및 등록금 납부만으로는 복학처리가 되지 않습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 원스톱서비스-학적에 사진이 없는 학생은 3월 28일까지 학생회관 1층 학사서비스</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;센터로 사진을 반드시 제출하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(미제출자는 원스톱서비스 사용 및 학사업무 불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"60\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;구분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"32\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"530\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일반 복학 &amp; 군제대 복학</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #0000